<%#
  Locals: href (optional) -- wraps in a link to that URL if given, otherwise
  renders as a plain label.

  The badge is a circle-cropped export of the full circular emblem, small
  enough that the ring text isn't meant to be legible -- it reads as a
  seal/trust mark rather than something to read letter by letter. See
  app/assets/images/logo-mark.png and prompts/phase-03-layout-shell.md: the
  full emblem doesn't survive at nav size, and a simplified horizontal
  lockup doesn't exist yet, so this is the interim mark until one does.
  alt="" because the wordmark right next to it already states the org name
  as visible text -- an alt text here would just repeat it for screen readers.
%>
<% content = capture do %>
  <%= image_tag "logo-mark.png", alt: "", width: 40, height: 40, class: "size-10 shrink-0 rounded-full" %>
  <span class="font-display text-h3 text-brand-700"><%= brand_wordmark %></span>
<% end %>
<% if local_assigns[:href].present? %>
  <%= link_to href, class: "flex items-center gap-3" do %>
    <%= content %>
  <% end %>
<% else %>
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><%= content %></div>
<% end %>
